{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive custom FAQ Accordion section that inherits the active theme's global styles and implements a modular, block-based architecture allowing users to dynamically add, remove, and reorder accordion blocks.
    
    The layout, visual hierarchy, and copy must 100% replicate the design structure seen in the reference "image_9d41fe.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Variables:** The section wrapper must inherit the current theme's typography variables (`var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container`), and default responsive side gutters/padding.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    - **Structural Container:** The FAQ blocks must stack vertically centered within the theme's maximum width box, featuring a vertical gap/margin of approximately 16px to 20px between each individual accordion box.
    
    ### 2. Accordion Container Block Architecture (Modular Blocks)
    The section must use a Liquid `{% for block in section.blocks %}` loop to render each FAQ accordion item. Each item is a separate block element featuring two visual states (Collapsed / Expanded):
    - **Card Wrapper Layout:** Each FAQ item must be enclosed in its own independent box with a clean white background, a very faint light-gray outer border, and smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 12px). 
    - **Header Trigger Row (Flexbox Layout):** The top row of each card acts as the clickable toggle zone. It should align items horizontally with a "space-between" layout distribution:
      - **Left Side Element Group:** A row aligning an icon box and the text groupings:
        - **Icon Box:** A small, rounded square badge with an ultra-light olive/green background tint. Inside, embed a clean line-art SVG icon corresponding to the question context.
        - **Text Column:** Stacked vertically next to the icon box:
          - **Category Tag:** A small, bold, olive-green text label (e.g., "Implementation & Deployment" or "Accuracy & Data Quality").
          - **Question Heading:** A prominent, bold, deep dark navy blue heading text.
      - **Right Side Toggle Element:** A clean chevron arrow icon (`svg`). 
        - When the accordion block is collapsed, the chevron points DOWN. 
        - When the accordion block is expanded, the chevron rotates 180 degrees to point UP.
    - **Content Expansion Panel:** A hidden panel that slides or toggles open smoothly directly underneath the header trigger row when active. It contains a multi-line body paragraph styled in a comfortable line-height, muted dark navy/gray body text.
    
    ### 3. Exact Content Text & Asset Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the initial section code or default block setup correctly includes this transcription from image_9d41fe.png:
    
    #### Accordion Block 1 (Rendered as Open/Expanded by default in image):
    - **Category Tag:** Implementation & Deployment
    - **Question Heading:** How long does implementation take from contract to go-live?
    - **Icon Type:** Clock / Timer line icon
    - **Chevron State:** Points UP
    - **Expanded Panel Body Text:** "Typical timeline is 4-6 weeks for a single store, 8-12 weeks for multi-store rollouts. Week 1-2: Infrastructure assessment and camera placement planning. Week 3-4: Hardware installation and network integration. Week 5-6: Calibration, validation, and staff training. For enterprise deployments (10+ stores), we follow a phased rollout: pilot store first (6 weeks), then standardized deployment at 2-3 stores per week. Timeline assumes existing network infrastructure meets requirements (PoE-capable switches, 100Mbps per camera). If network upgrades are needed, add 2-4 weeks for infrastructure work."
    
    #### Accordion Block 2 (Collapsed):
    - **Category Tag:** Implementation & Deployment
    - **Question Heading:** What infrastructure changes are required in our stores?
    - **Icon Type:** Database / Server stack line icon
    - **Chevron State:** Points DOWN
    
    #### Accordion Block 3 (Collapsed):
    - **Category Tag:** Implementation & Deployment
    - **Question Heading:** How do you handle partial deployments and expansion?
    - **Icon Type:** Shield / Protection line icon
    - **Chevron State:** Points DOWN
    
    #### Accordion Block 4 (Collapsed):
    - **Category Tag:** Accuracy & Data Quality
    - **Question Heading:** What does '98.5% accuracy' mean in operational terms?
    - **Icon Type:** Badge / Checkmark line icon
    - **Chevron State:** Points DOWN
    
    #### Accordion Block 5 (Collapsed):
    - **Category Tag:** Accuracy & Data Quality
    - **Question Heading:** How do you handle edge cases: children, groups, staff, after-hours?
    - **Icon Type:** Warning / Exclamation alert line icon
    - **Chevron State:** Points DOWN
    
    ### 4. Technical Logic & Interaction Requirements
    - **JavaScript / Liquid Toggle Engine:** Write a lightweight, self-contained JavaScript script (or use native HTML `<details>` and `<summary>` ele
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #f9fafb;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    min-width: 48px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_background_color }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-text-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.category_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, inherit);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.question_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-chevron-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    min-width: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-chevron-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.chevron_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-accordion-chevron-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.4s ease, padding 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 1000px;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-content-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 0 24px 24px 88px;
  }

  .ai-faq-accordion-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: {{ block.settings.answer_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-faq-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px 16px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      min-width: 40px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-content-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 16px 20px 16px;
    }

    .ai-faq-accordion-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.default_open %}active{% endif %}">
    <div class="ai-faq-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}" role="button" aria-expanded="{% if block.settings.default_open %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" tabindex="0">
      <div class="ai-faq-accordion-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-faq-accordion-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% case block.settings.icon_type %}
            {% when 'clock' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
              </svg>
            {% when 'database' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse>
                <path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3"></path>
                <path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"></path>
              </svg>
            {% when 'shield' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              </svg>
            {% when 'badge' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
                <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
              </svg>
            {% when 'alert' %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"></path>
                <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
              </svg>
            {% else %}
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
              </svg>
          {% endcase %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-faq-accordion-text-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.category != blank %}
            <div class="ai-faq-accordion-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.category }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.question != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-faq-accordion-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-faq-accordion-chevron-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-faq-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-faq-accordion-content-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.answer != blank %}
          <div class="ai-faq-accordion-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.item = this.querySelector('.ai-faq-accordion-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.header = this.querySelector('.ai-faq-accordion-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.content = this.querySelector('.ai-faq-accordion-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        if (this.header) {
          this.header.addEventListener('click', this.toggle.bind(this));
          this.header.addEventListener('keydown', this.handleKeydown.bind(this));
        }
      }

      toggle() {
        const isActive = this.item.classList.contains('active');
        this.item.classList.toggle('active');
        this.header.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isActive);
      }

      handleKeydown(event) {
        if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') {
          event.preventDefault();
          this.toggle();
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

